            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A system comprises a stowable support surface comprising a translucent display. The stowable support surface is configured to be moveable between a first position and a second position. The system further comprises at least one projector configured to project an image on the translucent display. The at least one sensor is configured to indicate a current position of the stowable support surface. The system further comprises a projector controller in communication with the at least one projector and the at least one sensor. The projector controller is programmed to: instruct the at least one projector to project at least one image on the translucent display when the stowable support surface is in the first position; receive a signal from the at least one sensor indicating that the stowable support surface is in between the first position and the second position; and instruct the at least one projector to halt projection of images.</p>
            </abstract>
